pan>\u00a0<strong>Real-World Impact \u2013 Support Shelters While You Play</strong> \u2013 Through <strong>limited-time in-game charity bundles</strong>, a portion of proceeds will go to real-life cat rescues. Players can unlock exclusive in-game rewards, such as cat outfits, shelter decorations, and special-themed items, while helping real cats in need.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/a13bd4ad4a851afba35d9d83ad8c048f.apng?t=1766350508\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/a13bd4ad4a851afba35d9d83ad8c048f.poster.avif?t=1766350508\" class=\"bb_img\" width=663 height=36 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/0b412abc19644564a1506c32099406b7.webp?t=1766350508\" width=22 height=19 /></span>\u00a0Immerse yourself in a charming world blending pixel art and soft, painterly visuals. Experience warmth, humour, and depth in each moment spent at the shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One cat can change everything. Will you help Mikan transform Neko House into a prosperous sanctuary?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/633c3c641d40d567755853ad79c55c93.poster.avif?t=1766350508\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/633c3c641d40d567755853ad79c55c93.webm?t=1766350508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/633c3c641d40d567755853ad79c55c93.mp4?t=1766350508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Mikan House Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/1301bda79929899cbc4de54509b9209a5609b98f/header.jpg?t=1766350508","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2317250/203163985/54420ddc31e9f25498200c78730af4ba23e03746/1751323381/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751325592","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2317250/203163985/54420ddc31e9f25498200c78730af4ba23e03746/1751323381/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751325592","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2317250/203163985/54420ddc31e9f25498200c78730af4ba23e03746/1751323381/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751325592","id":257163606,"name":"Neko House","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257163606/4292b791c51336c4bdccd07b559da9ed1c19f4da/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751325592"}],"name":"Neko House","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Mikan House Inc."],"ratings":null,"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/d33e1100bbe2b241b6e4ba056feb959d9c92d4bd/ss_d33e1100bbe2b241b6e4ba056feb959d9c92d4bd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766350508","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317